[en.FOCUS_C12_TRAIN_SPIES]
Train spies

[en.FOCUS_C12_TRAIN_SPIES_desc]
In order to gain an advantage against the Empire and other potential threats to our nation, we should train a group of proficient operatives to assist us in gathering intelligence. Limestone Pie will personally oversee this newly established department.

[zh.FOCUS_C12_TRAIN_SPIES]
训练特工

[zh.FOCUS_C12_TRAIN_SPIES_desc]
为了取得针对帝国和其他可能威胁到我们国家的优势，我们应该训练出一批精通的特工来帮助我们获得情报，石青派将亲自管辖这个新成立的部门。

